Hi, Yi,

If you have computed the projector matrix with
  proj <- inla.mesh.projector(mesh, dims=c(nrow, ncol))
you have the coordinates in each direction as
   proj$x
and
   proj$y
and in
   proj$lattice$loc
you have it expanded

Note.: the projector matrix is in
   proj$proj$A

Elias

